{"id":"3f44d69945b890a4","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-robinson-arithmetic.md","title":"Robinson Arithmetic","display":"df-robinson-arithmetic — Robinson Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-robinson-arithmetic","aliases":["88-df-robinson-arithmetic"],"display":"df-robinson-arithmetic — Robinson Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[88-df-formula]]","[[88-df-language]]","[[88-df-arithmetical-formula]]","[[88-df-sentence]]","[[88-df-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-robinson-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-robinson-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-robinson-arithmetic — Robinson Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\mathsf s,+,\\cdot\">\\(0,\\mathsf s,+,\\cdot\\)</span> (its nonlogical symbols)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (candidate Robinson arithmetic axiom set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nQ\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\n\\forall x\\;(\\mathsf s(x)\\neq0),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;(x\\neq0\\to\\exists y\\;(x=\\mathsf s(y))),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(\\mathsf s(x)=\\mathsf s(y)\\to x=y),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;(x+0=x),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(x+\\mathsf s(y)=\\mathsf s(x+y)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;(x\\cdot0=0),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(x\\cdot\\mathsf s(y)=x\\cdot y+x)\n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nQ\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\n\\forall x\\;(\\mathsf s(x)\\neq0),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;(x\\neq0\\to\\exists y\\;(x=\\mathsf s(y))),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(\\mathsf s(x)=\\mathsf s(y)\\to x=y),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;(x+0=x),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(x+\\mathsf s(y)=\\mathsf s(x+y)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\;(x\\cdot0=0),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(x\\cdot\\mathsf s(y)=x\\cdot y+x)\n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf s\">\\(\\mathsf s\\)</span>是对象语言符号，不与元层数值后继函数混写。</li>\n<li>七条公式均全称闭合，故<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>确为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>句子集。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0084b7b825c6c2d7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-arithmetical-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"13ac48daafe6d04f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"def3025c6c81c740","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0084b7b825c6c2d7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ (arithmetic signature, see [[88-df-arithmetical-formula]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\mathsf s,+,\\cdot","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nQ\\coloneqq\\{&\n\\forall x\\;(\\mathsf s(x)\\neq0),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\;(x\\neq0\\to\\exists y\\;(x=\\mathsf s(y))),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(\\mathsf s(x)=\\mathsf s(y)\\to x=y),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\;(x+0=x),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(x+\\mathsf s(y)=\\mathsf s(x+y)),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\;(x\\cdot0=0),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(x\\cdot\\mathsf s(y)=x\\cdot y+x)\n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(Q)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf s","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false}],"bytes":1316,"backlinks":[{"id":"de020d1a68bd3a49","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$Q$ (Robinson arithmetic, see [[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]])"},{"id":"ceae3257aec622e2","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q$ (Robinson arithmetic, see [[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]])"},{"id":"5946096a2536364f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q$ (Robinson arithmetic, see [[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]])"},{"id":"499d6d1436229742","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q$ (Robinson arithmetic, see [[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]])"},{"id":"111244cddc854123","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q$ (Robinson arithmetic, see [[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]])"},{"id":"254200a991dbb642","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q$ (Robinson arithmetic, see [[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]])"},{"id":"6bf67ec77619bc8d","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q$ (Robinson arithmetic, see [[88-df-robinso